(*---
description: Explores init disjunction and next enabled_guard with check plain.
ref: tlc2/tool/impl/Tool.java#getInitStates; tlc2/tool/impl/Tool.java#getNextStates
features:
  - state-space
outcome: any
config: |
  INIT Init
  NEXT Next
---*)
---- MODULE space_disjunction__enabled_guard__plain ----
EXTENDS Integers
VARIABLES x, y
vars == <<x, y>>
Assign(a, b) == x = a /\ y = b
Same(a, b) == a = a /\ b = b
Init == (x = 0 \/ x = 1) /\ y = 0
Next == ENABLED (x' = x) /\ x' = x /\ y' = y

====

